    "description": "Two decorative mantel or desk clocks from Tiffany & Co. and Lenox, each with their own distinctive styling:\nThe Tiffany & Co. clock has a classic rectangular brass-tone case with stepped feet and a large white dial featuring black Roman numerals and hands. The face is marked “Tiffany & Co.,” “Quartz,” and “Made in Germany.” Its understated architectural design gives it an elegant traditional appearance. Measures approximately 3 1/2” high x 3 1/2” wide. Has some light surface wear/tarnish consistent with age.\nThe Lenox clock features an ivory-colored porcelain case decorated with flying waterfowl and marsh grasses, accented by vertical ribbing and gold-tone trim. The round quartz clock face has Roman numeral hour markers and is signed Lenox. Measures approximately 5” wide x 3” high. No chips or cracks noted.\nGood pre-owned condition. Both clocks are untested, functionality has not been determined. Being sold as is. Please see photos for overall condition, measurements, and additional details.",
